-explaianing todays commmit what happening under the hood
1.INITIAL STATE - all qubits in qiskit start initialised in the ground state 0
2.HADAMARD GATE - creates a 50/50 quantam superposition.b4 measurement the qubit exists simultaneously in a state combining 0 and 1
3.MEASUREMENT COLLASPE - measuring the qubit forces its quantam state to collasi into a classical bit value 0 or 1 
4.HISTOGRAM - its a 50/50 probability running 1000 shots will yield roughly ~500 counts or 0 and ~500 counts for 1
